==Politics==
The [[commune in France|commune]] of Gardanne was governed by the [[French Communist Party]] under Mayor Roger Meï from 1977 until 2020. Voting is usually towards the left-wing, but rather uncharacteristically, [[Nicolas Sarkozy]] gained 53.1% of the vote at the second round of the [[2007 French presidential election]].{{citation needed|date=May 2007}}

